  "description": {
    "text": "The reward pack (奖赏包) is the one-card prize in the Happy Set Dragonite & Mewtwo & Camerupt & Sinistcha of 16 July 2026, shared out by the results of the games. It holds one of 14 holos: one of the eight basic Energy, in 87.5% of packs, or one of six Pokémon ex, in 12.5%: Arcanine ex, Slowking ex, Dedenne ex, Mimikyu ex, Lucario ex and Koraidon ex. The six Pokémon ex are numbered out of 6.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The new Happy Set: Dragonite & Mewtwo & Camerupt & Sinistcha (29 June 2026)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/22630.html"
      }
    ]
  },
